summary:
A &ldquo;bomb cyclone&rdquo; caused huge flooding in Nebraska. Our area faired pretty well, but 10 miles north of us was hit hard.
Keith says,
&ldquo;Columbus is a mess from what I’ve heard and you can’t get to Fullerton very easily&hellip; I wish I could have taken pictures of the Platte River the other day. Dad said he’s never seen the river so full&hellip;
